-- Description:
-- Function to return the primary location of the database.
-- Function to be replaced by method !!glbAllDb.primaryGet()
--
------------------------------------------------------------------------
--
-- Function Type:   Function/Procedure
-- Arguments:
--   [#] [R/RW] [Data Type] [Description]
-- Return:
--   [Data Type] [Description]
--    DBREF       DBREF of database primary location
